+ * 2084 (clause 5.5). It does not name one in HLG: the bridge composes that as one in ST 2084 where
+ * the RPU of the picture declares its HDR picture in ST 2084 (RpuDeclaresPq()), and no other
+ * (BaseLayerComposable()). Without this, either would come out as if the base layer were in PQ:
+ * the bridge has libplacebo compose them so (pl_render_params.dovi_ccm_bl_transfer) or not at all.
+ * A stream whose profile is not known (0) is not taken to be either.
+ */
+constexpr int BaseLayerTransferOf(int profile, int compatibility)
+{
+  return profile <= 0         ? BASE_LAYER_PQ
+         : compatibility == 2 ? BASE_LAYER_SDR
+         : compatibility == 4 ? BASE_LAYER_HLG
